WEBVTT

00:05.710 --> 00:07.260
You mustn't cry.

00:07.260 --> 00:08.650
Hey!

00:09.060 --> 00:11.460
Master Suou's been summoned by the Council!

00:11.460 --> 00:12.740
It finally happened?

01:48.480 --> 01:53.450
Suou, you are hereby appointed as
the new Chieftain of the Mud Whale.

01:53.450 --> 01:55.390
I humbly accept.

01:55.390 --> 01:57.230
You look pale.

01:57.230 --> 02:00.890
Wash your garments, lest you startle the citizens.

02:00.890 --> 02:05.140
If you cannot remove the filth, we will prepare you a new set.

02:05.970 --> 02:07.560
This is not filth.

02:08.210 --> 02:10.780
It's... Sami's...

02:12.880 --> 02:14.070
There, there.

02:14.820 --> 02:17.200
We had forgotten you were still a child.

02:17.200 --> 02:18.280
Mister Suou.

02:18.620 --> 02:19.570
Neri...

02:20.230 --> 02:21.320
Sorry.

02:23.610 --> 02:26.530
You must stop crying at some point, Suou.

02:26.530 --> 02:28.130
She's right.

02:28.130 --> 02:30.080
We're pained as well.

02:30.480 --> 02:32.960
However, we have a responsibility to uphold.

02:33.680 --> 02:39.180
We will give you your first and final duty as Chieftain.

02:40.090 --> 02:44.310
The Council of Elders has come to a unanimous decision.

02:45.750 --> 02:49.810
We will sink the Mud Whale into the Sand Ocean.

02:50.940 --> 02:55.270
What do you mean?! Where will we go then?

02:55.270 --> 02:56.890
Where will we live?

02:56.890 --> 03:01.570
We will drown in sand alongside the Mud Whale.

03:02.640 --> 03:08.340
You will lead everyone to a
proud death as the last Chieftain.

03:08.340 --> 03:12.130
That is your first and final duty.

03:18.810 --> 03:20.170
Why is that?

03:21.030 --> 03:23.180
Why must everyone die?!

03:23.940 --> 03:29.430
Those who attacked us came from the country we were once part of.

03:31.290 --> 03:35.440
Our ancestors were cast into the Sand Ocean
after committing a certain sin.

03:36.700 --> 03:39.440
That exile has continued to this day.

03:40.120 --> 03:45.530
But now, they have decided that
it is finally time for our execution.

03:46.950 --> 03:53.470
Those soldiers were ordered to kill
every last person living on the Mud Whale.

03:56.770 --> 04:01.550
Their goal is not conquest, but extermination.

04:01.910 --> 04:04.720
We have no means of resisting them.

04:02.220 --> 04:04.720
...don't want to...

04:05.220 --> 04:07.840
Why do I...

04:05.220 --> 04:09.850
Who among us wishes to see the people of the Mud Whale murdered in cold blood?

04:10.480 --> 04:15.180
It is necessary to meet a peaceful end such that we might die with dignity.

04:17.320 --> 04:18.560
Elder Byakuroku!

04:18.560 --> 04:23.780
Father... No, I don't wanna be killed!

04:24.330 --> 04:27.810
I don't wanna drown to death either!

04:27.810 --> 04:30.120
He has gone senile.

04:30.120 --> 04:32.160
Take Elder Byakuroku to his room.

04:32.660 --> 04:35.620
Head Elder, it's all right.

04:35.620 --> 04:36.580
You'll be all right.

04:38.080 --> 04:42.360
I won't allow you to die meaninglessly like Sami and Lady Taisha did!

04:42.360 --> 04:43.050
Suou!

04:44.190 --> 04:46.450
I don't want to let anyone else die!

04:46.450 --> 04:49.180
There must be a way for us all to survive!

04:49.180 --> 04:51.350
Oh, right!

04:51.740 --> 04:57.480
Father, ask Falaina!
Falaina knows everything.

04:57.900 --> 05:00.980
Falaina? The island girl mentioned that name.

05:01.910 --> 05:04.590
Does it not refer to the Mud Whale?

05:05.200 --> 05:06.610
Suou! That's enough!

05:07.790 --> 05:09.600
You have no need to know.

05:11.350 --> 05:13.450
Please tell me, Head Elder.

05:14.020 --> 05:17.080
What is it? Just what in the world is Fala—

05:19.430 --> 05:25.550
I believe you instructed me to restrain him in a situation like this. Is this acceptable?

05:25.880 --> 05:29.050
Y-Yes. Just as we agreed upon.

05:30.070 --> 05:32.640
Please take care of the
underground security too, Captain.

05:36.960 --> 05:39.670
I never expected him to act like that.

05:39.670 --> 05:42.650
He is still young. We can't blame him.

05:43.010 --> 05:46.110
We'll have to put this behind us and proceed.

05:46.790 --> 05:48.870
Now, begin the preparations,

05:49.850 --> 05:50.700
Neri.

06:08.100 --> 06:09.680
What're you writing?

06:10.070 --> 06:11.180
D-Don't look!

06:11.920 --> 06:15.140
Don't worry, it's all Greek to me! Besides...

06:16.680 --> 06:20.210
If you don't want people reading it,
don't go scribbling it out here.

06:21.520 --> 06:27.900
So Tobikko told me that you used your thymia
to take out some of those guys who attacked us.

06:31.000 --> 06:35.200
I heard the only people who could
stand up to them were you and Ouni.

06:35.200 --> 06:37.040
Not bad for the destroyer!

06:37.040 --> 06:38.630
You're pretty amazing!

06:38.630 --> 06:39.870
Stop that.

06:40.630 --> 06:44.520
I couldn't do anything. That's why Sami died.

06:45.130 --> 06:49.300
I don't want to hear anything about fighting or taking people out anymore!

06:50.480 --> 06:53.490
Is that why you're carving excuses into the wall?

07:01.260 --> 07:05.360
Samikko might have died, but you saved Tobikko's siblings, didn't you?

07:06.280 --> 07:09.270
That's praiseworthy. Hold your head up high.

07:09.270 --> 07:11.860
I can't be as carefree as you.

07:11.860 --> 07:14.370
It's not "you", it's Big Sis Ginshu!

07:14.680 --> 07:16.990
Who cares what I call you?

07:16.990 --> 07:18.560
I do!

07:18.560 --> 07:21.490
What name you use for others is important.

07:21.490 --> 07:24.380
It shows exactly what you think of them.

07:25.060 --> 07:31.010
I'll teach you how to use thymia properly so that you can fight them the next time they come.

07:31.350 --> 07:34.690
That's why I want you to treat me with respect and call me "Big Sis Ginshu"!

07:34.690 --> 07:35.760
Now, let me hear it!

07:36.850 --> 07:39.270
Big Sis... Ginshu.

07:42.260 --> 07:45.640
That's perfect! You got it, Chakki!

07:45.640 --> 07:46.750
It's Chakuro.

07:46.750 --> 07:48.440
Don't sweat the small stuff!

07:49.060 --> 07:51.060
I'll see you around, Chakki!

07:51.060 --> 07:51.820
It's <i>Chakuro</i>!

08:21.410 --> 08:23.270
Chakuro!

08:24.240 --> 08:25.150
Neri?

08:27.890 --> 08:31.280
You can't climb up from that side.
Come around the back.

08:32.790 --> 08:33.740
Chakuro.

08:37.600 --> 08:39.620
Isn't it beautiful?

08:40.230 --> 08:43.960
Do you know the reason why this world is beautiful?

08:46.600 --> 08:51.850
The souls of all the people who have lived in this world have melded into it.

08:53.160 --> 08:55.720
Like here, just look.

08:57.510 --> 08:59.140
What is that?

09:13.940 --> 09:17.060
What is... Who are they?

09:21.120 --> 09:22.520
Sami!

09:23.290 --> 09:26.040
Sami... you're alive...

09:29.040 --> 09:33.760
I never got to tell you, but I wanted to be your wife.

09:33.760 --> 09:35.110
Sami...

09:36.670 --> 09:39.180
Wait... Sami!

09:39.810 --> 09:41.640
I loved you too!

09:43.370 --> 09:50.070
Even with our short lives as Marked, even if our bodies were to weaken until our death,

09:51.470 --> 09:54.320
I wanted to spend my life with you.

09:55.160 --> 09:58.580
If I'm not even allowed such a modest wish,

09:58.580 --> 10:02.410
I have no reason to go on living!

10:02.750 --> 10:04.690
Take me with you.

10:05.200 --> 10:06.410
I can't.

10:07.870 --> 10:11.020
You have a duty only you can do.

10:12.280 --> 10:13.660
Wait...

10:13.660 --> 10:14.340
Precisely.

10:15.980 --> 10:18.050
You are the archivist of the truth.

10:18.380 --> 10:19.970
Lady Taisha...

10:19.970 --> 10:26.530
The Mud Whale is on course to sink, with not a single soul knowing the truth of this island.

10:27.920 --> 10:29.960
We will simply disappear.

10:31.440 --> 10:34.560
You must see it all through to the last.

10:36.290 --> 10:40.000
And the end of this island is still far, far away.

11:08.100 --> 11:09.060
Ouni!

11:21.580 --> 11:22.740
Suou!

11:31.780 --> 11:32.500
Lykos!

11:43.110 --> 11:45.180
Neri... what was that?

11:45.630 --> 11:48.520
Hey, could you see Sami and everyone else too?

11:48.920 --> 11:52.770
Could you see Suou and Lykos suffering?

11:55.050 --> 12:02.240
You have the ability to vividly perceive the hearts of others, though you may not be aware of it.

12:02.900 --> 12:07.450
If you don't unite everyone, it will truly be the end.

12:10.540 --> 12:11.460
Chakuro!

12:11.460 --> 12:15.090
Please help! I found out their plans!

12:15.090 --> 12:15.880
Huh?

12:15.880 --> 12:20.090
The Council of Elders wants to sink the Mud Whale and everyone on it!

12:20.520 --> 12:24.780
Mister Suou opposed them, and they've imprisoned him in the bowels.

12:24.780 --> 12:25.720
Is that true?

12:26.050 --> 12:31.180
Before you can save everyone, there's someone whose heart you must set free.

12:31.180 --> 12:33.030
Please go to her.

12:43.020 --> 12:43.850
Lykos.

12:45.020 --> 12:45.990
Are you crying?

12:49.220 --> 12:53.420
The ship I was on was originally supposed to attack Falaina.

12:54.050 --> 12:56.270
But we didn't know a thing.

12:56.270 --> 12:59.720
They told us this island was like hell.

12:59.720 --> 13:03.090
Yet we were the ones who made it that way...

13:04.420 --> 13:07.640
You've become able to show so much more emotion.

13:08.550 --> 13:12.470
Don't worry. I've seen your heart twice now.

13:12.470 --> 13:14.860
I trust you, Lykos.

13:17.730 --> 13:20.920
Hey, Lykos. I need your help.

13:20.920 --> 13:23.030
Otherwise we'll all drown in the Sand Ocean.

13:28.200 --> 13:29.720
What do I need to do?

13:37.180 --> 13:39.340
I still can't believe it.

13:39.860 --> 13:43.380
Nobody is supposed to be able to control the Mud Whale's heading.

13:43.380 --> 13:48.140
So why does the Council of Elders know a way to sink it?

13:48.790 --> 13:50.930
I think I might know what it is.

13:52.210 --> 13:56.450
Is there anywhere on this island
where nobody's allowed to enter?

13:58.850 --> 14:00.810
The bowels! It's underground!

14:01.390 --> 14:06.950
Part of it is used as a prison, but the rest of the area is secret and kept off-limits!

14:08.110 --> 14:08.700
Underground...

14:12.160 --> 14:12.840
Lykos!

14:20.330 --> 14:22.920
Suou is locked up down there right now.

14:23.410 --> 14:24.810
We have to save him too.

14:28.310 --> 14:30.510
Make sure you separate out any arrows we can't use.

14:30.900 --> 14:32.050
'Kay.

14:32.050 --> 14:36.350
Seven days will pass before you know it. We need to be prepared for their attack.

14:36.350 --> 14:38.270
'Kay, 'kay.

14:39.120 --> 14:41.190
Do you really get it?

14:49.560 --> 14:51.490
Masoo, are you okay?

14:51.490 --> 14:52.380
Y-Yeah.

14:52.380 --> 14:53.450
Masoo!

14:53.450 --> 14:55.660
Nezu! Rou!

14:56.590 --> 14:59.650
Oh, Chakuro. We were just
gathering the hunting weapons.

14:59.650 --> 15:01.040
There's no time for that!

15:02.460 --> 15:04.800
What?! The Mud Whale's going to sink?!

15:05.260 --> 15:07.340
That's why I need your help.

15:07.340 --> 15:09.810
Whoa, slow down! I don't get this...

15:09.810 --> 15:15.470
Opposing the Council means you'll have to get through the Self-Defense Force.

15:15.470 --> 15:16.430
The SDF...

15:17.880 --> 15:20.140
Can the five of us really do that?

15:31.770 --> 15:32.360
Kicha.

15:32.850 --> 15:34.700
Where's... Ouni?

15:42.700 --> 15:43.680
Ouni!

15:45.260 --> 15:46.690
We need your help!

15:46.690 --> 15:48.040
Who said you could come in?

15:48.040 --> 15:50.670
If we don't do anything, the Mud Whale is going to sink!

15:50.990 --> 15:52.320
I'm begging you!

15:55.880 --> 16:03.440
We're trapped on this tiny island, and just when I thought we'd found the outside world, we got totally destroyed.

16:04.310 --> 16:07.150
Is there anything worth saving on this island?

16:07.810 --> 16:10.610
I've just... had enough.

16:14.300 --> 16:15.510
An Apathoia.

16:16.030 --> 16:18.180
Hey, is that a captive?

16:18.180 --> 16:20.620
That's right, we caught him.

16:21.200 --> 16:23.870
That's an emotionless soldier. He's still alive.

16:25.480 --> 16:26.340
Hands off!

16:27.000 --> 16:31.060
There's no need to treat someone without a heart like a person.

16:31.060 --> 16:33.330
What I decide to do to him,

16:33.330 --> 16:36.930
or whether they abandon this
worthless island or not, none of it matters!

16:38.760 --> 16:40.720
That's a lie.

16:40.720 --> 16:43.730
Ouni, you're not saying what you really think!

16:45.490 --> 16:50.050
Your friends were killed, and all your dreams and aspirations for the outside world were shattered.

16:50.640 --> 16:54.300
I understand why you've lost hope, but!

16:54.820 --> 16:57.370
I saw what's truly in your heart!

16:57.780 --> 17:03.750
You're in pain because you can't figure out
the right way to protect everyone, aren't you?

17:06.320 --> 17:07.130
Chakuro!

17:07.520 --> 17:10.870
Every single one of you tries to file us into your boxes...

17:11.750 --> 17:14.300
Don't just decide who I <i>really</i> am!

17:17.120 --> 17:19.940
Chakuro, just give up on him.

17:19.940 --> 17:23.900
If you keep wasting time trying to
convince him, we'll all end up sinking.

17:26.030 --> 17:26.810
Let's go.

17:38.120 --> 17:40.980
It's no good, the SDF's here too.

17:40.980 --> 17:43.000
Then there really is something down there.

17:43.360 --> 17:45.340
Screw it, we're breaking through!

17:55.950 --> 17:58.550
Sorry, but it's kind of an emergency.

17:58.910 --> 18:00.370
Nice one, Masoo!

18:00.950 --> 18:05.210
You're looking at the man who turned down a position as SDF scout. This is a piece of cake.

18:06.210 --> 18:08.440
That said, I <i>am</i> a bit tired.

18:09.280 --> 18:10.830
Did you hear something?

18:10.830 --> 18:12.400
Damn, they're inside too?

18:12.870 --> 18:14.230
You guys handle them!

18:14.230 --> 18:17.690
We don't really use thymia all that much ourselves.

18:17.690 --> 18:20.240
That's the problem with kids these days!

18:20.240 --> 18:20.910
Huh?

18:21.220 --> 18:22.910
Chakki! What're you doing here?

18:23.300 --> 18:24.300
Gin...

18:25.210 --> 18:28.580
C'mon Chakki, don't give me that look.

18:29.330 --> 18:30.790
What happened here?

18:30.790 --> 18:32.540
W-Well...

18:33.720 --> 18:35.050
What are you doing?!

18:35.720 --> 18:38.130
Big Sis! Big Sis Ginshu!

18:38.130 --> 18:39.430
Big Sister!

18:40.440 --> 18:44.010
We need to get past! Please let us through, Big Sister Ginshu!

18:45.230 --> 18:45.970
Hey, Ginshu!

18:46.360 --> 18:47.310
These guys—

18:49.270 --> 18:52.900
Ginshu! The Council ordered us not to let anyone underground!

18:53.540 --> 18:56.030
I don't know what the Elders are thinking.

18:56.440 --> 19:00.710
But I can see clear as day that Chakki needs my help!

19:05.200 --> 19:08.080
This is all for you, my cute little Chakki!

19:08.560 --> 19:10.670
Huh? Where's Chakki?!

19:10.670 --> 19:13.130
Chakki!

19:14.090 --> 19:17.760
Chakki, when did you get in with the SDF?

19:17.760 --> 19:18.840
Don't call me Chakki!

19:20.160 --> 19:21.800
<i>Ginshu, thank you.</i>

19:27.330 --> 19:28.510
Captain?

19:28.510 --> 19:30.440
Out of the pan and into the fire.

19:34.930 --> 19:36.880
He's strong.

19:36.880 --> 19:42.110
Obviously! Only people with powerful thymia get accepted into the Self-Defense Force!

19:42.440 --> 19:46.870
And since he's their leader, that means he's the strongest! He's the Mud Whale's number one!

19:47.930 --> 19:48.870
If you want some...

19:52.820 --> 19:55.720
H-Huh? Talk about a letdown...

19:55.720 --> 19:56.750
Creepy.

19:57.270 --> 20:00.130
Forget him. Beyond this are the bowels.

20:00.540 --> 20:03.170
You can't use your thymia down there, so be careful.

20:07.920 --> 20:10.320
I knew I sensed you here.

20:11.860 --> 20:14.860
Are you here as their backup?

20:15.850 --> 20:17.230
Guess that's not your style.

20:17.880 --> 20:20.090
You might be kind of a problem.

20:21.020 --> 20:21.950
You shall not pass!

20:22.680 --> 20:24.660
Just kidding. Bring it.

20:25.180 --> 20:29.010
If you want to try to get past, I'm game.

20:31.580 --> 20:33.660
It suddenly got quiet.

20:35.090 --> 20:37.290
Looks like this is the no-trespassing area.

20:39.150 --> 20:41.800
Where do you think Suou's locked up?

20:42.330 --> 20:45.250
Nezu and I will look around and find him.

20:45.250 --> 20:49.570
Leave it to us! Suou's our new Chieftain and all, right?

20:49.570 --> 20:51.980
But how will you get him out?

20:52.910 --> 20:56.470
With this, a jailbreaking tool we invented in the workshop.

20:56.470 --> 20:58.690
You damn kids made something like that?!

20:59.240 --> 21:02.860
The Council of Elders should be
somewhere in the off-limits zone.

21:02.860 --> 21:05.570
We'll go ahead and investigate, and meet up later.

21:05.970 --> 21:06.810
Sure!

21:10.010 --> 21:10.990
Let's go.

21:14.070 --> 21:16.330
Does the air feel heavy to you?

21:18.850 --> 21:21.880
Lykos, just what is down here?

21:21.880 --> 21:24.170
What can they use to sink the Mud Whale?

21:24.560 --> 21:28.300
Seriously, Chakuro? You brought me along without even knowing?

21:28.650 --> 21:29.970
Sorry.

21:29.970 --> 21:30.510
Chakuro.

21:31.450 --> 21:33.330
You already know.

21:33.330 --> 21:36.420
It's the same as what you touched back then.

21:42.530 --> 21:43.670
Light!
